URL: https://restoapp.com/admin/stock-manager#overview
Path: Sidebar -> Stock Manager -> Click "Обзор" tab.
Description: Interface for managing availability of dishes. Allow searching for dishes or browsing by category. Shows "Unlimited" or numeric stock status.

